     CALL "BE4-ENCH-TICK" USING WS-IDX WS-A WS-FA WS-FB WS-DRAWS WS-B
     COMPUTE WS-SHOW ROUNDED = (BE-XF(WS-IDX, 5)) * 1000000
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "300000 400000 500000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

